        "original_id": "e770cba1-2bfb-50d5-a346-ee57d05f39d9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Dobson, Frederick J. \"Fred\" Dukes, Wilmer Valderrama, María Conchita Alonso, Kathleen Barr, Mary Elizabeth McGlynn, Cusse Mankuma\n- Characters: Starscream, Supreme Kai, Nappa, Cobra Commander, Blob, Leonardo, Pythor, The Blob\n- Works: Transformers Unicron Trilogy, Dragon Ball Z, X-Men, The Condor\n- Companies: Marvel Comics\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Dobson is best known for voicing Starscream in the Transformers Unicron Trilogy.\n- Michael Dobson is also known for voicing Supreme Kai and Nappa in the Ocean dub of Dragon Ball Z.\n- Michael Dobson has voiced Cobra Commander, Blob, Leonardo, Pythor, and many other characters in animated shows and anime dubs.\n- The Blob, whose real name is Frederick J. \"Fred\" Dukes, is a fictional supervillain in American comic books published by Marvel Comics.\n- The Blob is usually depicted as an adversary of the X-Men.\n- The Blob is a mutant originally depicted as an obese circus freak who claims to be immovable when he chooses.\n- The film The Condor features the voices of Wilmer Valderrama, María Conchita Alonso, Kathleen Barr, Michael Dobson, Mary Elizabeth McGlynn, and Cusse Mankuma.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
